 "title": "The Poet of Silver Jews",
 "cat": "art",
 "emoji": "🎸",
 "sentences": [
  "David Berman founded the indie rock band Silver Jews.",
  "He was the only constant member throughout its existence.",
  "Berman published a volume of poetry titled Actual Air.",
  "His cynical lyrics often discussed his struggles with substance abuse.",
  "After a 2003 suicide attempt, he engaged with Judaism.",
  "He dissolved the band and withdrew from public life.",
  "He later returned to music as Purple Mountains."
